{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37937","headline":"和进士张曙闻鴈见寄 · 崔涂","name":"和进士张曙闻鴈见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"断行哀响递相催，争趁高秋作恨媒。\n云外关山闻独去，渡头风雨见初来。\n也知榆塞寒须别，莫恋苹汀暖不回。\n试向富春江畔过，故园犹合有池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}